उप-√ मन्त्र् P. Ā. -मन्त्रयति, -ते to call near or towards one's self, call hither, induce to come near, TS.; ŚBr.;
to summon, invite, persuade, MBh.; Kām.; BhP.;
to address.

उप-√ मृद् P. -मृद्नाति, to graze in passing (said of a heavenly body in its transit), VarBṛS.;
to crush, destroy, annul, Naiṣ. Comm. on BṛĀrUp. :
Caus. -मर्दयति, to destroy, devastate, annul, annihilate, BhP. Comm. on ChUp. & BṛĀrUp.
